  message: "Fixed via merged PR (dev 455a1a187a). Re-measured premise on the current self-corpus default run: total_io_edges 8428, external_potential 8134 = 96.5% (the ~9x/28x over-count REPRODUCES on the default invocation; correctness_strategy's 'external_potential=0' applies only to the tier-filtered build). Fix (WI-foduh sibling): total_io_edges redefined to exclude the external_potential bucket (now 294 real edges); external_potential_edges discloses the 8134 separately so the bucket's receiver-unresolved builtin noise (append/get/split) no longer inflates the headline ~28x. INV-pubom canonical definition amended (2026-06-30): unfiltered/filtered/text paths agree. Test test_total_io_edges_excludes_external_potential_disclosed_separately locks the split. awaits_bakeoff_validation: headline moves ~28x."  # 359d
